From: Artur Andrzejczak <andrzejczak.artur@gmail.com>
Date: Fri, 19 Sep 2026 09:30:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] ggml-cuda: gfx1013 is RDNA1

vendors/hip.h defines RDNA1 for gfx1010 and gfx1012 only. gfx1013 (Cyan
Skillfish, the BC-250's APU) is the same architecture and without the macro it
takes none of the RDNA1 code paths, including the tables the later patches add.

Co-authored-by: Claude Fable 5.1 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Signed-off-by: Artur Andrzejczak <andrzejczak.artur@gmail.com>
---
diff --git a/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/vendors/hip.h b/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/vendors/hip.h
index 9aa558f..3534566 100644
--- a/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/vendors/hip.h
+++ b/ggml/src/ggml-cuda/vendors/hip.h
@@ -229,9 +229,9 @@
 #define RDNA2
 #endif
 
-#if defined(__gfx1010__) || defined(__gfx1012__)
+#if defined(__gfx1010__) || defined(__gfx1012__) || defined(__gfx1013__)
 #define RDNA1
-#endif // defined(__gfx1010__) || defined(__gfx1012__)
+#endif // defined(__gfx1010__) || defined(__gfx1012__) || defined(__gfx1013__)
 
 #if defined(RDNA4) || defined(RDNA3) || defined(RDNA2) || defined(RDNA1)
 #define RDNA // For the entire family
